      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this three-bedroom, mid-terrace family home to the market in the popular and well-established Coolmine Park, Clonsilla, Dublin 15.\nIdeally positioned, Coolmine Park is within easy reach of a wealth of local amenities including schools, shops, public transport and recreational facilities. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just a short drive away, while commuters are exceptionally well catered for with excellent access to the M50 and N3 motorway networks. Train stations and bus routes are also within easy reach, making this an excellent location for those commuting throughout Dublin.\nThe property offers approximately c. 77 sq.m of accommodation and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen extension, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. Externally, the property benefits from a generous rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space and further potential.\nNo. 51 comes to the market requiring some renovation and offers an excellent opportunity for purchasers looking to put their own stamp on a property and create their ideal family home. The existing kitchen extension provides additional living space, while the generous rear garden further enhances the property's potential. Attractive opportunity for those looking to renovate and create a forever home in a lovely residential setting.\nOffered to the market with no onward chain, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families, investors and those seeking a renovation project with excellent potential.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n• C. 77 sq.m\n• 3 bed / 1 bath mid-terrace house\n• BER D\n• Kitchen extension\n• Generous rear garden\n• Excellent potential to create a forever home\n• No onward chain\n• Lovely residential location\n• Close to schools and shops\n• Train stations and bus stops within easy reach\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre approximately 5 minutes away\n• Easy access to the M50 & N3 motorway networks\n• Excellent transport links\n• Ideal renovation opportunity\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
